WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:13.831
Open a task and point to the three dots in the top right corner. The tooltip names the button Card actions. Open it to find Park, Move to canvas, and Close. Choosing Close folds the task back onto the canvas.

00:00:14.785 --> 00:00:23.265
Open the Archive to revisit a discarded prototype. The prototype has the same menu in its top right corner. Choosing Close takes you back to the Archive.

00:00:24.218 --> 00:00:35.418
Open Card actions with the keyboard. Escape is listed beside Close. Press it once while the menu is open to fold the card back to the canvas and return focus to its card face.
